  "description": "BAVVOL crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C86 H72 Cl4 Dy6 N18 O26,C2 H3 N1,C1 H4 O1,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.849-4.942 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 110.74-169.93°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C89H81Cl4Dy6N19O28. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
